he frame.\n    rs = list(range(rp - 1, h, rp))\n    cs = list(range(cp - 1, w, cp))\n    return [[grid[r][c] for c in cs[:-1]] for r in rs[:-1]]\n```\n{\"action\":\"submit\"}","steps":[],"action":{"type":"submit"}},{"step":68,"kind":"observation","phase":"act","t0":1790607724.161,"t1":1790607736.701,"alias":"task-b33e5329","message":"Feedback since your last action:\nYour submission was INCORRECT. Wrong attempts so far: 7.\n\nSame instance. Task id: task-b33e5329\nTest input (30x29):\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n7 9 7 7 7 7 7 9 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n7 9 7 7 7 7 7 9 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 0 7 7 7 7 7 0 7 7 7\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n7 4 7 7 7 7 7 4 7 7 7 7 7 4 7 7 7 7 7 0 7 7 7 7 7 0 7 7 7\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n7 4 7 7 7 7 7 4 7 7 7 7 7 4 7 7 7 7 7 8 7 7 7 7 7 8 7 7 7\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1\n1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1 1 7 1 1 1 1